### SKU stats by client (aggregation, no pagination)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/statsByClient HTTP/1.1

###

### Run aggregation pipeline on Sku collection
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/aggregate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

{
  "pipeline": [
  {
    "$match":
      {
        "clientName": "ZLD",
        "patternDict.barcode": {
          "$exists": true
        }
      }
  }
]
}

###

### Search SKUs with date range and embeddingDone filter
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/?clientName=TEST&barcode=019&createdAfter=2024-01-01&createdBefore=2025-12-31&embeddingDone=true&pageNum=1&pageSize=10 HTTP/1.1

###

### Search internal SKUs associated to a client
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/?clientName=BZT&assetType=internal&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Get SKU by id (includes all assets)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/66b309153245805b74739602 HTTP/1.1

###

### Lookup SKU by clientName and barcode (includes all assets)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/lookup?clientName=ZLD&barcode=4068378470647 HTTP/1.1

###

### Partner: Get SKU by clientName and barcode
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/byClientAndBarcode?clientName=ZLD&barcode=4068378470647 HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Search SKUs (clientName required; filter by any field or filter[] for patternDict keys)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/?clientName=TEST&filter[fabric]=cotton&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Search SKUs with multiple values for a single filter (e.g. fabric = velvet OR silk)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/?clientName=TEST&filter[fabric]=["velvet","silk"]&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

###

### Partner: SKU semantic search (returns _id, barcode, skuImageDescription)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner: SKU semantic search with FX_Gender filter
GET https://aistylingasset.flixstock.com/api/v1/sku/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt&filter[FX_Gender]=Male HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner: SKU filter-only (no fuzzy_text, pulled from vector store)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&filter[FX_Gender]=Male HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner: SKU filter — multiple values for FX_Gender (Male OR Female)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&filter[FX_Gender][]=Male&filter[FX_Gender][]=Female HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: YW94M5m7SYZov3S8K1gLtrVKdr6nS8J6

###

### Partner SKU semantic — missing/invalid API key (401)
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/semanticSearchPartner?clientName=BZT&fuzzy_text=red+cotton+shirt HTTP/1.1

