### Import CSV - hero_articles (TEST client)
# Response: { ingestionId, skusTotal, skusIdentified (existing updated), skusNew (not found, inserted) }
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/importCsv?clientName=TEST HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hero_articles.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< /Users/flixstock/Downloads/Copy of AI image production_Batch 1_data - supporting_articles.csv
--Boundary--

