###

### Stop producing for a SKU (upserts SkuCsv flag; cascades to Sku + Assets + vector if Sku exists. Gates reads only.)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/doNotProduce HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "barcode": "0194891764698", "clientName": "BZT", "shouldNotProduce": true }

###

### Re-enable production for a SKU
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/doNotProduce HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "barcode": "0194891764698", "clientName": "BZT", "shouldNotProduce": false }

###

### doNotProduce - SKU not yet created (200, upserts SkuCsv stub so flag is honoured at future Sku creation)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/doNotProduce HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "barcode": "DOES_NOT_EXIST", "clientName": "BZT", "shouldNotProduce": true }

###

### doNotProduce - missing shouldNotProduce (celebrate 400)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/doNotProduce HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "barcode": "0194891764698", "clientName": "BZT" }


### Save CSV data for a barcode (merges into existing csvData; creates SkuCsv if missing)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/saveCsvData HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barcode": "0194891764695",
  "clientName": "TEST",
  "csvData": {
    "category": "t1",
    "color": "blue"
  }
}


### saveCsvData - csvConfig validation failure (missing required column / disallowed value, returns Api400Error)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/saveCsvData HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barcode": "0194891764695",
  "clientName": "BZT",
  "csvData": {
    "color": "not-an-allowed-value"
  }
}


### saveCsvData - missing csvData (celebrate 400)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/sku/saveCsvData HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "barcode": "0194891764695", "clientName": "BZT" }
